
### Add User
POST http://localhost:8080/personalwebsite/users/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@gmail.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### Update User By ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/personalwebsite/users/update/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Smith",
  "email": "johnsmith@gmail.com",
  "password": "NewPassword123"
}

### Get User By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/personalwebsite/users/6acd820564878036e2138a16

### Delete User By ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/personalwebsite/users/6acd820564878036e2138a16

### Test Empty Name Exception
POST http://localhost:8080/personalwebsite/users/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "test@gmail.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

